# Claude worktrees (temporary)
.claude/worktrees/
.codex/worktrees/

# Agent skills rendered output (canonical source is agent-specs/skills/)
# Tracking both .agents/skills/ and .claude/skills/ creates 3-way drift.
# Canonical: agent-specs/ → rendered to .claude/skills/ (actively read by Claude Code).
# .agents/skills/ is a legacy third copy — gitignore from 2026-04-17 to simplify canonical governance.
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Machine-local Claude Code permissions（Claude Code 官方慣例即為不進版控）。
# 每個 session 允許一條新 Bash 指令就改寫它一次，於是每班 fire 都看到它 dirty、
# 每班都沒有作者可歸屬 → 26 班的「沒人收」警報，把 orphan 警報的訊噪比長期壓低。
# 共用設定（env / hooks / 團隊 permissions）在 .claude/settings.json，那份仍 tracked；
# 這份只放本機權限，untrack 不會失去任何共用的東西。
# 之前只靠使用者的全域 ~/.config/git/ignore 擋，換台機器 clone 就會再度被 track。
.claude/settings.local.json

# Local control-plane runtime state
storage/ops/tasks/
storage/ops/agents/
storage/ops/executions/
storage/ops/approvals/
storage/ops/rollback_points/
storage/ops/legacy_retirement_observations/
# Operations Core retirement signals and their coordination locks are live
# machine state. They are consumed under the batch lock and preserved on disk,
# but must never become PHASE-Z/Git ownership candidates.
storage/ops/legacy_retirement_signals/
storage/ops/*.lock
storage/ops/compute_queue/*.lock
storage/ops/locks/
storage/ops/writer_log.jsonl
# Supabase delete-reconcile recovery dumps (rows removed from articles mirror) —
# local recovery artifact written by scripts/supabase_sync.reconcile_article_deletes,
# not canonical source. Kept on disk for recoverability, out of git (like writer_log).
storage/ops/supabase_reconcile_removed_*.jsonl
# Telegram responder runtime state (message log + poll cursor) — runtime noise, not canonical
storage/ops/telegram_inbox.jsonl
storage/ops/telegram_state.json

# Cron / sync auto-generated state (2026-05-28: stop 113K-line noise per boss)
