data/vixtwn/vixtwn_daily.csv

# Experiments INDEX auto-regenerated (canonical = per-experiment README)
experiments/INDEX.md
experiments/index.json

# More auto-updated state (2026-05-28 second pass)
storage/risk_forecast.json
# storage/strategy_metrics.json — removed from gitignore 2026-06-08: file is derived from
# paper_trading.json (no external deps), remote env has no daily_update cron so it was
# never auto-regenerated, causing persistent ops patrol alerts since 2026-05-31.
# Now committed; recalc_metrics.py still refreshes it on local runs.
storage/reports/trending_repost_log.json

# Legacy lazypack render scratch: gen_lazypack_codex.py copied article bodies next to
# the panels so the generated render script cites a re-runnable path instead of a
# reaped /var/folders temp. It is derived from feed.json (regenerate with
# --article-id) and no fire commits it, so tracking it strands an orphan that
# PHASE-Z re-alerts every shift. Panels + render script stay tracked.
storage/lazypack_jobs/**/panels/*_article.md

# 3rd-party tool caches
.antigravitycli/
.codex-companion/
# 2026-07-14: /conftest.py used to be ignored here as a 'stray'. On 2026-07-10 a
# real root conftest was added to hold the four production guards for the whole
# test tree — and this line silently kept it out of every CI checkout, so
# scripts/tests/ ran on the runner with VOLPRED_NO_REMOTE_READ unset. Tracked now.

